# Its id leads with aspect-: a State of the same name (Raging, Mindful, God Ki) has the bare one.
id: aspect-realization
name: Realization
polarity: positive
# number: its script is the whole of it. moment: entering, leaving, the start of a turn (stages 4-5).
# rule: how a Transformation is entered, left or Mastered - asked by transformations.mjs aspectLevel.
group: rule
# The rule in short, for its hovers; its own words below (the page the user gave, 2026-11-20).
summary: >
  Each Higher Scale counts as a different Transformation for Legend Realized.
text: >
  Realization: You can restore your energy and vitality more easily in this Transformation.
  –Effect: You may treat each Higher Scale on this Transformation as if it was a different Transformation for the sake of Legend Realized.

---

# Nothing it does by itself yet: the Transformation Maneuver and Mastery read it.
